{
  "id": "semi-nmf-dictionary",
  "title": "Semi-NMF dictionary of activations",
  "description": "Factor activations into nonnegative codes times an unconstrained dictionary with semi-nonnegative matrix factorization, solved by multiplicative updates instead of training an SAE. Features in these models fire with nonnegative magnitude, which matches the nonnegative-code assumption, and there is no amortized encoder to cause absorption. Prediction: recovers the planted feature directions at least as well as a tuned TopK SAE.",
